Under the line management of the Senior Data officer, the REACH Data Analyst is responsible for the production of REACH’s analysis products, including the preparation of research design, support in designing sampling methods, data analysis plans, data collection tools, data cleaning scripts and processes, analysis scripts, analysis outputs and production of web maps and information management systems. The Data officer will support in the dissemination and evaluation stages of the research cycle.

In his/her mission, the Data Analyst will be employed by ACTED and will be under the direct responsibility and management of ACTED’s Country Director and his/her delegates for all Administrative, Security, Logistics, and Finance issues.

